452c3ff": "没有|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e9dee0e4": "有用|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5637c0d3": "爷爷|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "bc78e0ad": "奶奶|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "24a24524": "牛奶|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "651b02ed": "爸爸|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "297d00ad": "妈妈|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "bfc0b822": "和好|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "89d20f3f": "暖和|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1d09e7c5": "放学|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a904baec": "回来|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "44d6a17a": "迟到|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4fdad4cf": "送给|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "310b5c9a": "吃完|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3799f3a2": "把手|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "bc8c93f7": "今天一放学，我和弟弟就跑回家帮妈妈布置房间。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b0a01291": "今天是奶奶的生日，大家都来我家了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3ed77b7f": "我们一家人围着桌子坐，真热闹。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d9cc3708": "爷爷戴着新眼镜，笑着给我们讲故事。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "431a5492": "奶奶说，今天是她最开心的一天。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b0f0b85d": "妈妈做了很多好吃的菜，有鱼，还有饺子。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3346e2bc": "爸爸负责拍照，给我们拍了很多照片。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4fa2c6c7": "弟弟不小心把牛奶洒了，妈妈说：“没关系。”|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a482dc5b": "我和弟弟吵了几句，可是很快就和好了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7d8dcfc0": "爸爸路上堵车，迟到了一会儿，可是正好赶上唱生日歌。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "cb1da35e": "爷爷指着院子说：“这里的花是我种的。”|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8c0722e4": "我送给奶奶一幅画，奶奶说要挂在客厅里。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b3072881": "这次你没有来，大家都很想你。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "de6f2cc6": "妈妈问我：“要不要再吃一块蛋糕？”我说：“好的，谢谢妈妈！”|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "eaa7bddb": "大家吃完蛋糕以后，一起看了爸爸拍的照片。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4245c356": "晚上九点，客人们都回家了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "58dd5114": "今天是奶奶的生日，孩子们一放学就回到家了！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a2c902e3": "奶奶，这是我的礼物，是我画的画！|zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural|-10%", "62d5043d": "真好看！画上有爷爷，还有我们的小狗。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-22%|-12Hz", "355fa78b": "哈哈，小狗也想吃蛋糕呢！|zh-CN-YunyangNeural|-20%|-8Hz", "47d73914": "爸爸妈妈，快把蜡烛点上吧！|zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural|-10%", "5e31515c": "好！大家一起唱生日歌。|zh-CN-YunxiNeural|-12%", "89bf9c33": "祝您生日快乐！这件新衣服是我和爸爸送给您的。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "78612f3c": "谢谢你们！蛋糕快吃完了，有你们在，我真开心。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-22%|-12Hz", "ba937c28": "我的|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0728781f": "家里|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1cd2051d": "这些|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6422ba85": "有趣|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "25cd0062": "老爷爷|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "fb28636d": "奶茶|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b4de1bdd": "爸妈|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4809fcca": "大妈|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c1bf2848": "和平|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3c023992": "放假|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "99d88f4f": "回答|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "56d9900e": "看到|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "07b9b49c": "给你|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "58668dd3": "做完|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0d13f18f": "一把|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "417a5327": "Bingo!|en-US-AvaNeural|-12%"}